    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy is delighted to present No. 64 Ballygossan Park to the market. Superbly positioned just off the highly sought after Golf Links Road, this stunning three bedroom family home offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a high-specification, A-rated property with an additional garden studio. \n\nDesigned for comfort and energy efficiency, the home opens into a welcoming entrance hallway with high ceilings. The ground floor features a spacious, light-filled front living room. Double doors lead to a generous kitchen and dining area, the home's social hub. Featuring French doors to the garden. A practical utility room and guest WC complete this level.\n\nUpstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a luxurious primary suite with a contemporary en-suite, alongside a stylish main family bathroom. Boasting an energy efficient A3 BER rating, the home ensures exceptionally low running costs and qualifies for favorable Green Mortgage rates.\n\nThe low maintenance private rear garden hosts a fantastic, detached garden room. Fully equipped with electricity and heating, this versatile studio is ideal as a quiet home office, playroom, or relaxation space. A private cobble-locked driveway to the side offers ample off-street parking.\n\nBallygossan Park is a very popular, family friendly development offering an unbeatable lifestyle. The property is within walking distance of Skerries' town centre, award-winning restaurants, schools, beaches, and the commuter train station (approx. 12 minutes' walk). Sports enthusiasts will appreciate proximity to Skerries Golf Club, sailing, rugby, GAA, and tennis clubs. Strategically positioned 12 miles from Dublin Airport with easy access to the M1/M50 network, this home offers the perfect synergy of coastal peace and city accessibility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> EV Charger</li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> Garden Studio with Lighting</li><li> Off Street Parking</li><li> Master Bedroom En-Suite</li><li> Guest WC & Utility Room</li><li> High Ceilings Through Out</li><li> Triple Glazed Windows</li><li> Wooden Flooring</ul>"
      },
